# INVWINUC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the Admin menu's
# operations, audit log and sessions at level 3.  Backup asks for a
# directory, which it needs: NOSUCH is not found, INV's text in a
# message box; "." takes the backup.  Restore from "." asks first: No
# sends nothing, Yes restores.  Pack asks, then says the records it
# removed; Reindex says every index was rebuilt.  Audit log asks for its
# filter: a record without its table is refused in the dialog, on the
# table; ITEMS and record 1 show that item's rows, where ENTER, CTRL-E, INS
# and DEL do nothing, and ESC goes back to the item list.  Sessions in
# local mode is refused (104) in a message box, which ends its dialog.
# The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINUC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A B
S DIRASK
T nosuch
K ENTER
S NODIR
K ENTER ALT-A B ENTER
S DIRREQ
T .
K ENTER
S BACKEDUP
K ENTER ALT-A R
T .
K ENTER
S RESTOREQ
K N ALT-A R
T .
K ENTER Y
S RESTORED
K ENTER ALT-A P
S PACKQ
K Y
S PACKED
K ENTER ALT-A I
S REINDEXD
K ENTER ALT-A A
S FILTER
K TAB
T 1
K ENTER
S NEEDTBL
T items
K ENTER
S AUDIT
K ENTER CTRL-E INS DEL
S NOREC
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-A S
S NOSESS
K ENTER
S ENDED
K ALT-F X
